\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3^{x-2}&=6\\\\\n\\log_3\\left(3^{x-2}\\right)&=\\log_3(6).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing $\\log_b(b^c)=c$ gives $x-2=\\log_3(6)$. Adding $2$ to both sides, we obtain\n\n$$\nx=\\log_3(6)+2.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186111370 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ca4f8723-559a-576e-896f-c04862fc607f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x = \\log_{5} (15)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109946} {:answer/id #uuid "1c1dbb2d-69dd-5dbb-88af-4d884a572321" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x = \\log_{5} \\left(\\frac{1}{15}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109947} {:answer/id #uuid "3659b40e-5a0c-53a6-9523-0025a1860dc6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x = \\log_{5} \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109948} {:answer/id #uuid "5a85980f-82ed-54cd-b847-5d4bb10648ea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x = \\log_{5} (3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109949} {:answer/id #uuid "68cb3d0c-c21e-5cb1-b41c-016834544214" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x = 5\\log_{5} (3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109950}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ca4f8723-559a-576e-896f-c04862fc607f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x = \\log_{5} (15)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109946} :answer-field/id #uuid "c916e90e-2038-5685-aa96-f883c27c4155" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109945}] :question/id #uuid "3e958238-ee2a-58d3-b257-eafe2e7f6b42" :question/math-academy-id "q-66805" :question/problem "Find the exact solution of the equation $5^{x} = 15$." :question/worked-solution "We take $\\log_5$ of both sides of 